# logue mkII oscillator slash commands

When the user message contains **`/logue-mkii-`** (or **`/mkii-osc-`** alias):

1. Load **`.agents/skills/logue-mkii-oscillator/SKILL.md`** (command router).
2. Load **`.cursor/agents/logue-mkii-oscillator/SYSTEM.md`** (hard constraints).
3. Load the matching **`.agents/workflows/logue-mkii-<phase>.md`** file.
4. Execute the matching **`.agents/skills/logue-mkii-<phase>/SKILL.md`** when present.
5. Read/update **`src/mkii/oscillators/<slug>/.agent/status.json`** (create on first brief).
6. **Stop after one phase** unless user said `/logue-mkii-new` or asked to continue.
7. **Ship** requires passing **`./tools/osc-eval-mkii.sh <slug>`** (build when `LOGUE_SDK` available).

| Command | Workflow | Phase skill |
|---------|----------|-------------|
| `/logue-mkii-setup` | `logue-mkii-setup.md` | `logue-mkii-setup` |
| `/logue-mkii-brief` | `logue-mkii-brief.md` | `logue-mkii-brief` |
| `/logue-mkii-design` | `logue-mkii-design.md` | `logue-mkii-design` |
| `/logue-mkii-scaffold` | `logue-mkii-scaffold.md` | `logue-mkii-scaffold` |
| `/logue-mkii-impl` | `logue-mkii-impl.md` | `logue-mkii-impl` |
| `/logue-mkii-eval` | `logue-mkii-eval.md` | `logue-mkii-eval` |
| `/logue-mkii-ship` | `logue-mkii-ship.md` | `logue-mkii-ship` |
| `/logue-mkii-debug` | `logue-mkii-debug.md` | `logue-mkii-debug` |
| `/logue-mkii-status` | `logue-mkii-status.md` | — |
| `/logue-mkii-resume` | `logue-mkii-resume.md` | — |
| `/logue-mkii-new` | `logue-mkii-new.md` | all phases (confirm between) |

**Aliases:** `/mkii-osc-brief` = `/logue-mkii-brief`, etc.

**Default target:** NTS-1 mkII (`.nts1mkiiunit`). v1.1 only when user explicitly requests `tools/build.sh`.

